      "PostedDate": "2026-05-19T20:45:33.177Z",
      "BriefDescription": "This role is built for an engineer who is energized by the deal as much as the design. As a Sales Engineer at Ezurio, you sit at the intersection of deep technical know-how and real customer impact, helping companies bring winning wireless products to market with our embedded modules, SOMs, and antennas. You will be the first commercial and technical voice many customers hear, the partner our distributors lean on, and the person who decides which opportunities are worth chasing. Expect to lead discovery calls, match the right Ezurio solution to each use case, and help close designs that ship in volume. Bring engineering credibility, sharp commercial instincts, real hunger to win, and a team-first mindset, and this role will stretch and reward you in equal measure.",
